## Gotchas for the next agent (this checkout)

- The store/bulk JSONs are LF in the working copy; git warns "LF will be replaced
  by CRLF" and `git status` lists the bulk shards as modified after every rebuild
  even when content-identical. `git diff --cached --numstat` on them must show
  NOTHING before you commit (normalization only); if it shows lines, stop.
- `Select-String ... | ForEach-Object { $_.LineNumber + ": " }` throws (int + string
  cast); use "$($_.LineNumber): ..." interpolation.
- `git show <rev>:<path>` redirected from PowerShell mangles encoding; extract
  binary-safe via python subprocess (this lane's check_stale.py pattern).
- qualify --consumer-graph needs its --output dir to exist; it never touches the
  committed projection (consumer.DEMO_DIR is redirected to scratch).
- Background suites: redirect to a log file and READ THE LOG; never pipe native
  output through Select-Object -First (kills the writer mid-run).

